# Python bytecode from scripts/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Third-party dev skills vendored by `npx skills` (mattpocock/skills).
# The lock file is committed so the set is reproducible; the copies are not,
# since they are someone else's content and would bury the project.
# Restore with: npx skills experimental_install
.claude/skills/
